  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n −\n ÷\n ×\n +\n \n \n\n Stands For\n ÷\n ×\n +\n −\n \n \n\nGiven: 9 ÷ 12 × 450 + 8208 − 18 = ?\n\n9 ÷ 12 × 450 + 8208 − 18 = ? ⇒ 9 × 12 + 450 − 8208 ÷ 18 = ?\n\n⇒ 9 × 12 + 450 − __**8208 **____**÷**____** 18**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**9 ×**____** 12**__ + 450 − 456 = ?\n\n⇒ __**108**____** + 450**__ − 456 = ?\n\n⇒ __**558**____** − 456**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 102 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
